    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22452" root="شعث" body-key="$">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اشعث مِنِّى فُلَانٌ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>Such a one was angry by
reason of me;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَضِبَ</span>. (A. [But this I have
not found elsewhere; and I almost think that
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اشعث</span>, in my copy of the A, may be a mistranscription for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شعّث</span>; and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَضِبَ</span>, for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَضَّ</span>.])

